<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>The primary challenge with this problem is in handling its edge cases. B=
efore tackling these edge cases, let=E2=80=99s first try handling the more =
basic cases and later see how we would need to modify our strategy.</p>
<p><strong>Reversing positive numbers</strong><br>
<!-- -->Consider n =3D 123. Let's try building the reversed integer one dig=
it at a time. The first thing to figure out is how to iterate through the d=
igits of n to build our reversed number (initially set to 0):</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
